  "notes": "Latest ACNC Annual Information Statement CSV plus the programs CSV and explanatory notes. Every measure is jurisdiction_level=charity, jurisdiction=Australia, funding_source=\"ACNC-registered charity\", measure_type=actual. The total expenses row is aggregation_role=expense_total and the five component categories are expense_component; they are never summed together. No COFOG function. State/postcode comes only from program operating locations, single-state only, flagged location_approximate. Bytes are archived outside the repo."
